| logical_plan  | Sort: NULL ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |   Projection: A.MaxRate, count(Int64(1)) AS Count                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[A.MaxRate]], aggr=[[count(Int64(1))]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: A                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |         Projection: number_info_with_cap.MaxRate                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |           BytesProcessedNode                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |             Filter: number_info_with_cap.AccountSid = LargeUtf8("AC02da2b759e8342d4b73ff6e64a77ce58") AND number_info_with_cap.NumberPoolSid = LargeUtf8("NPcb39bd63c0a54ab8b106d8f9e0aa6507") AND number_info_with_cap.NumberSid != LargeUtf8("PN00000000000000000000000000000099") AND number_info_with_cap.Capability = LargeUtf8("sms") AND (number_info_with_cap.AvailableForNumberSelection = Int8(1) OR number_info_with_cap.AvailableForNumberSelection = Int8(0))                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |               TableScan: number_info_with_cap projection=[AccountSid, NumberPoolSid, NumberSid, MaxRate, AvailableForNumberSelection, Capability]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
